%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant System as 🖥️ 鸿蒙系统
    participant Entry as EntryAbility<br/>(UIAbility)
    participant Window as WindowStage
    participant Index as Index.ets<br/>(@Entry)
    participant Iot as IotService<br/>单例
    participant Theme as ThemeManager<br/>单例
    participant AppS as AppStorage<br/>全局状态

    System->>Entry: onCreate(want, launchParam)
    Entry->>Entry: context.setColorMode(COLOR_MODE_LIGHT)
    Entry->>Iot: getInstance().init(IOT_CONFIG)
    Iot->>Iot: authenticate() → IAM Token 缓存
    Entry->>Theme: getInstance().init()
    Theme->>AppS: 从 PersistentStorage 恢复 themeName
    Entry-->>System: onCreate() 完成

    System->>Entry: onWindowStageCreate(windowStage)
    Entry->>Window: windowStage.loadContent('pages/Index')
    Window->>Index: 创建 Index 组件

    System->>Index: aboutToAppear()
    Index->>AppS: setOrCreate('navPathStack', stack)
    Index->>AppS: setOrCreate('currentBreakpoint', 'sm')

    System->>Index: build()
    Index->>Index: onAreaChange → 计算断点
    Index->>AppS: setOrCreate('currentBreakpoint', bp)
    alt 窄屏 (XS/SM)
        Index->>Index: Tabs(barPosition=End) + 4 TabContent
    else 宽屏 (MD/LG/XL)
        Index->>Index: SideNavBar(220vp) + Navigation(Stack)
    end

    Note over Index,AppS: 所有子页面通过 @StorageLink 响应断点/主题变化
